<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown cuts Harcourt.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown cuts Harcourt.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it cut its rating on Harcourt General Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Harcourt General shares lost 7/8 to 48-3/8 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Harcourt General owns publisher Harcourt Brace Jovanovich and a majority stake in Neiman Marcus Group.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
